# Migration v3 → v4

## Breaking Changes

| v3 | v4 | Notes |
|----|----|-------|
| `tailwind.config.js` with `theme.extend.colors` | `@theme { --color-* }` | Map `theme.extend.colors` → `--color-*`, `theme.extend.spacing` → `--spacing-*`, etc. |
| `@tailwind base` / `@tailwind components` / `@tailwind utilities` | `@import "tailwindcss"` | Single import replaces directives. |
| `darkMode: 'class'` | `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));` | Class strategy with custom variant. |
| `safelist: [...]` in config | `@source inline("...")` in CSS | Inline safelisting for dynamic classes. |
| `shadow-sm` | `shadow-xs` | Scale changed: `shadow-2xs`, `shadow-xs`, `shadow-sm`, `shadow-md`... |
| `flex-shrink-*` | `shrink-*` | Shorter utilities. |
| `flex-grow-*` | `grow-*` | Shorter utilities. |
| `outline-none` | `outline-hidden` | New semantic name. |
| `ring` (default) | `ring-1` / `ring-3` | Ring defaults changed. |
| `bg-opacity-*` | `bg-black/50` | Use opacity modifier. |
| `text-opacity-*` | `text-black/50` | Use `/` modifier. |
| `blur` | `blur-sm` | Scale adjusted. |
| `rounded-sm` | `rounded-xs` | Radius scale shifted. |
| `shadow` | `shadow-sm` | Default shadow renamed. |
| `theme()` function | `var(--*)` | Use CSS variables. |

## Behavior Notes

- `@layer components` + `@apply` continues to work.
- `@utility` does **not** use `@apply`; declare CSS directly.
- `--breakpoint-*` for viewport media queries; `--container-*` for `@container` queries.
- New capabilities: `@theme inline`, `@reference`, `@theme static`.

## Examples

```css
@import "tailwindcss";

@theme {
  --color-brand-500: oklch(0.65 0.18 250);
  --spacing: 0.25rem;
}

@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));
@source inline("{hover:,}bg-red-{50,100..900..100,950}");
```

Prefer verified renames from https://tailwindcss.com/docs/upgrade-guide; mark uncertain items as "verify".
